            crm:P190_has_symbolic_content "a sweet pale yellow or whitish concrete juice obtained from incisions in the bark of the Manna-ash, Fraxinus Ornus, formerly in the Near East, now chiefly in Calabria and Sicily; used in medicine as a gentle laxative (OED s.v. manna n.^1 4a; Heyd 615-6) | a sweet pale yellow or whitish concrete juice obtained from incisions in the bark of the Manna-ash, Fraxinus Ornus, formerly in the Near East, now chiefly in Calabria and Sicily; used in medicine as a gentle laxative (OED s.v. manna n.1 4a; Heyd 615-6)" ;
